nce","C":"Not opened","D":"Always rejected"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Rebate offered in a tender is:","options":{"A":"Ignored","B":"Considered in evaluation as per conditions","C":"A bribe","D":"Added to price"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Discount for prompt payment:","options":{"A":"Is illegal","B":"Is never considered","C":"Is evaluated if the tender provides","D":"Is mandatory"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"The tender committee may call tenderers for:","options":{"A":"Bribes","B":"Employment","C":"Lunch","D":"Clarifications on their offers"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Post-tender modifications by bidders are:","options":{"A":"Not permitted except clarifications","B":"Encouraged","C":"Mandatory","D":"Freely allowed"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Canvassing by tenderers leads to:","options":{"A":"Preference","B":"Rejection of the offer","C":"Negotiation","D":"Award"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Collusive tendering (cartel) is:","options":{"A":"Ignored","B":"Encouraged","C":"Dealt with as per rules; offers may be rejected","D":"Rewarded"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"A tender committee with finance member is required:","options":{"A":"For stationery only","B":"Always regardless of value","C":"Never","D":"As per SOP thresholds for the value involved"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Acceptance of tender at higher than estimated cost needs:","options":{"A":"Justification and competent authority approval","B":"Vendor's approval","C":"Staff consent","D":"No justification"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The letter of acceptance creates:","options":{"A":"Nothing","B":"A binding contract between railway and supplier","C":"An invitation","D":"A complaint"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Supply orders against rate contracts are placed:","options":{"A":"By the vendor","B":"Without any formality","C":"Directly on the rate contract holder","D":"Through fresh tender"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"Delivery schedule in the purchase order is:","options":{"A":"Optional","B":"Decided later","C":"Advisory","D":"Binding, with LD for delay"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Staggered delivery 